#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:17
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Common use of &sflphone-client-kde;"
msgid "Common use of &ring-kde;"
msgstr "Uobičajeno korištenje &sflphone-client-kde;"

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:20
#, no-c-format
msgid "Handling a call"
msgstr "Rukovanje pozivom"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:22
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "There are a bunch of features that you can apply on a current call with "
#| "&sflphone;. Here are their descriptions."
msgid ""
"There are a bunch of features that you can apply on a current call with "
"&Ring;. Here are their descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Postoji velika količina efekata koje možete primjenjivati na trenutni poziv "
"sa &sflphone;. Navešćemo njihove opise."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Placing a new call"
msgstr "Uspostava novog poziva"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can have plenty of calls in parallel, even if only one is current (&ie;: "
"you can talk through) and the others are on hold. To place a new call when "
"you are on a current call, click on the Place new call button, it will "
"create a new empty item and select it automatically, then type the phone "
"number you want to call and click <guibutton>Call</guibutton> or press "
"&Enter; to place the call. You can also go to the &i18n-history-w; or the "
"&i18n-address-w; and valid a call, and it will be added ringing in the &i18n-"
"current-w;. When a new call is placed, any other one is put on hold, so that "
"you cannot mix two calls. If you want to go back to one of the calls put on "
"hold, just double-click on the corresponding item and it will go back to "
"current state while the old one is put on hold."
msgstr ""
"Možete voditi više poziva istovremeno, iako je jedan trenutan, a ostali na "
"čekanju. Za uspostavu novog poziva kada trenutno vodite razgovor, "
"pritisnite  na tipku Uspostavi novi poziv, to će kreirati novu praznu ikonu "
"i označiti je automatski, a zatim utipkajte telefonski broj koji želite "
"pozvati i pritisnite  <guibutton>Pozovi</guibutton> ili pritisnite &Enter; "
"za uspostavu poziva. Također možete otići i u &i18n-history-w; ili  &i18n-"
"address-w; i verificirati poziv, i on će biti dodan sa zvonom u &i18n-"
"current-w;. KAda je uspostavljen novi poziv, svi ostali su na čekanju, tako "
"da se dva poziva ne pomješaju. Ako se želite vratiti na neki poziv na "
"čekanju, samo dvaput kliknite na odgovarajuću ikonu i vratiće se u trenutno "
"stanje dok se stari stavlja na čekanje."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Holding a call"
msgstr "Poziv na čekanju"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to place the current call on hold, you just have to click on the "
"Hold button. The icon of the call will then be changed and communication is "
"paused with your peer. You can then place a new call, transfer the held one "
"(see <xref linkend=\"common-use-current-transfer\"/>)... To take the "
"communication back, just double-click on the item or click on Unhold button."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite trenutni poziv staviti na čekanje, samo trebate kliknuti na "
"Čekanje tipku. Ikona poziva će biti promjenjena i komunikacija će biti "
"pauzirana. Zatim možete uspostaviti novi poziv, prebaciti onaj sa čekanja "
"(vidjeti <xref linkend=\"common-use-current-transfer\"/>)... Za preuzimanje "
"komunikacije, jednostavno dvaput kliknite na ikonu ili Prekini čekanje tipku."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "Transferring a call"
msgstr "Prebacivanje poziva"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to transfer the current call to another phone number, click on "
"the <guibutton>Transfer</guibutton> button, the item will change and enable "
"you to type the number to which you want to transfer your peer. Once you "
"have typed it, click on Valid transfer button or press &Enter; to "
"effectively transfer the call. You can place the call on hold while typing "
"the number (see <xref linkend=\"common-use-current-hold\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Ako zelite trenutni poziv prebaciti na drugi teleonski broj, pritisnite "
"<guibutton>Prebaci</guibutton> tipku, ikona će se promjeniti i omogućiti vam "
"tipkanje broja na koji želite prebaciti poziv. Kada ste otipkali broj "
"pritisnite na Potvrdi transer tipku ili pritisnite &Enter; da prebacite "
"poziv.Poziv možete staviti na čekanje dok tipkate broj (pogledati <xref "
"linkend=\"common-use-current-hold\"/>)."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:50
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recording a call"
msgstr "Snimanje poziva"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:52
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you want to record the current call, click on the <guibutton>Record</"
#| "guibutton> button, the button will become triggered and the light may "
#| "come on. Since &sflphone; only records calls when they are current (&ie;: "
#| "not on hold), the light will be on if the selected call is current and "
#| "can be recorded, and off if it is not. But if the button is triggered, "
#| "&sflphone; will record as soon as it is communicating."
msgid ""
"If you want to record the current call, click on the <guibutton>Record</"
"guibutton> button, the button will become triggered and the light may come "
"on. Since &Ring; only records calls when they are current (&ie;: not on "
"hold), the light will be on if the selected call is current and can be "
"recorded, and off if it is not. But if the button is triggered, &Ring; will "
"record as soon as it is communicating."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite snimiti trenutni poziv, pritisnite  <guibutton>Snimi</guibutton> "
"tipku, tipka će se aktivirati i svjetlo se može uključiti. Kako &sflphone; "
"snima pozive samo kad su oni trenutno aktivni (&ie;: nije na čekanju) "
"svijetlo će biti uključeno ako je poziv trenutačan i može se snimati, a "
"ugašeno ako nije. Ako je tipka aktivirana, &sflphone; će snimati čim počne "
"komunikacija."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Call mailbox"
msgstr "Folder sa govornim porukama"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can call your mailbox typing your account's mailbox number. But if you "
"have registered this number in account's settings, you can just click on "
"Mailbox button. It will call the mailbox of the first registered account."
msgstr ""
"Vašu govornu poštu možete pozvati tako što ukucate broj vaše govorne pošte. "
"Ali ako ste ovaj broj registrovali u postavkama računa onda jednostavno "
"možete kliknuti na Govorna pošta tipku. Tako ćete pozvati govornu poštu sa "
"prvog registrovanog računa."

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:64
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "In both case, you can then type your mailbox's password without worrying "
#| "about people around, since &sflphone; will not display what you type if "
#| "the called number is the registered mailbox number of the current call's "
#| "account."
msgid ""
"In both case, you can then type your mailbox's password without worrying "
"about people around, since &Ring; will not display what you type if the "
"called number is the registered mailbox number of the current call's account."
msgstr ""
"U oba slučaja, možete unijeti vašu šifru za govorni poštu bez brige o "
"ljudima okolo, jer &sflphone; neće prikazati šta kucate ako je broj "
"registrovan kao broj govorne pošte na trenutnom računu za pozive."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the address book"
msgstr "Korištenje imenika"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:72
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&sflphone-client-kde; communicates with the &kde; Address Book and "
#| "gathers all the phone numbers matching your request and the options "
#| "chosen. Here we will explain how to configure and use it."
msgid ""
"&ring-kde; communicates with the &kde; Address Book and gathers all the "
"phone numbers matching your request and the options chosen. Here we will "
"explain how to configure and use it."
msgstr ""
"&sflphone-client-kde; komunicira sa &kde; Imenikom i skuplja sve telefonske "
"brojeve koji odgovaraju vašem zahtjevu i izabranoj opciji. Ovdje ćemo "
"objasniti kako konfigurisati i koristiti iste."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:76
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuring &kde; Address Book"
msgstr "Konfigurisanje &kde; Imenika"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:78
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "As it is fully designed for &kde;, &sflphone-client-kde; looks for your "
#| "contacts in &kde; Address Book. So you first have to configure it. Choose "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Applications</guimenu><guisubmenu>Office</"
#| "guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Address Book</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
#| "&kmenu;. You are now in the main window of the &kde; address book. You "
#| "can add contacts and handle them from here. Press <keycap>F1</keycap> to "
#| "see this application's help page if you have some problems with it."
msgid ""
"As it is fully designed for &kde;, &ring-kde; looks for your contacts in "
"&kde; Address Book. So you first have to configure it. Choose "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Applications</guimenu><guisubmenu>Office</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Address Book</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"&kmenu;. You are now in the main window of the &kde; address book. You can "
"add contacts and handle them from here. Press <keycap>F1</keycap> to see "
"this application's help page if you have some problems with it."
msgstr ""
"Kako je u potpunosti dizajniran za &kde;, &sflphone-client-kde;  traži vaše "
"kontakte u &kde; Imeniku. Zbog toga ga morate prvo konfigurisati. Odaberite "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Aplikacije</guimenu><guisubmenu>Ured</"
"guisubmenu><guimenuitem>Imenik</guimenuitem></menuchoice> iz &kmenu;. Sada "
"se nalazite i glavnom prozou  &kde; imeniku. Možete dodati kontakte i "
"upravljati kontaktima odavde. Pritisnite <keycap>F1</keycap> da biste "
"vidjeli pomoć za ovu aplikaciju, ako imate nekih problema sa korištenjem."

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:81
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&sflphone-client-kde; looks into the standard address book, that means it "
#| "will look into the contacts displayed in the contact list on the left of "
#| "the window. The selected address books in the bottom left of the window "
#| "will be searched. If you add some contacts, you may have to restart "
#| "&sflphone-client-kde; before it can see them."
msgid ""
"&ring-kde; looks into the standard address book, that means it will look "
"into the contacts displayed in the contact list on the left of the window. "
"The selected address books in the bottom left of the window will be "
"searched. If you add some contacts, you may have to restart &ring-kde; "
"before it can see them."
msgstr ""
"&sflphone-client-kde; pregleda standardni imenik, što znači da će pregledati "
"kontakte u listi kontakata u lijevom dijelu prozora. Odabrani imenik u "
"donjem lijevom prozoru će biti sašuvani. Ako dodate određene kontakte, možda "
"ćete morati ponovno pokreuti &sflphone-client-kde; prije nego što budu "
"učitani."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:89
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Configuring &sflphone-client-kde;"
msgid "Configuring &ring-kde;"
msgstr "Konfiguracija &sflphone-client-kde;"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:91
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can now go to the Configuration Dialog to choose how &sflphone; will "
#| "handle your searches in the address book. This step is optional though, "
#| "because the default settings enable you to use the feature without more "
#| "setup."
msgid ""
"You can now go to the Configuration Dialog to choose how &Ring; will handle "
"your searches in the address book. This step is optional though, because the "
"default settings enable you to use the feature without more setup."
msgstr ""
"Sada možete otići u Konfiguracijski okvir da izaberete kako će &sflphone; "
"pretraživati imenik. Ovaj korak je opcionalan , jer podrazumjevane postavke "
"omogućavaju vam da koristite ove efekte bez dodatnih podešavanja."

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:94
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The maximum results setting enables you to choose how many phone numbers can "
"be displayed when you look for a contact. &kde; address book can contain "
"lots of contacts, especially if connected to <acronym>LDAP</acronym> "
"directories, and you do not want to see thousands of contacts displayed as "
"soon as you type a letter to search for."
msgstr ""
"Postavljanje maksimalnog broja rezultata omogućava da izaberete koliko će "
"brojeva biti prikazano kao rezultat pretrage kontakata. &kde; imenik može "
"sadržavati veliki broj kontakata, pogotovo ako je spojen na <acronym>LDAP</"
"acronym> direktorije, a vi ne želite da vam se prikaže hiljadu kontakata čim "
"unesete jedno slovo pretrage."

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:96
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "&kde; address book can contain a photo for your contacts. &sflphone-"
#| "client-kde; can display it in the result of your searches, but as it can "
#| "take a little more time, you can choose to disable that feature."
msgid ""
"&kde; address book can contain a photo for your contacts. &ring-kde; can "
"display it in the result of your searches, but as it can take a little more "
"time, you can choose to disable that feature."
msgstr ""
"&kde; imenik može da sadrži i fotografije za vaše kontakte. &sflphone-client-"
"kde; može da prikaže fotografije u rezultatima pretrage, ali kako to može da "
"traje određeno vrijeme, možete onemogućiti tu opciju."

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each phone number in &kde; address book is linked to a contact, and has a "
"phone number type to differentiate work phones, home phones, and cell "
"phones. You can choose to display only certain of those numbers. Check the "
"types you are interested in and uncheck the other ones."
msgstr ""
"Svaki telefonski broj u &kde; imeniku je povezan sa kontaktom, i ima "
"telefonske brojeve koji su razdvojeni na poslovne, kućne i mobilne telefone. "
"Možete izabrati prikaz samo određenih brojeva.Provjerite tipove za koje ste "
"zainteresovani, a ostale odznačite."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Search in Address Book"
msgstr "Traži u Imeniku"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now that everything is set up, you can go to the &i18n-address-w;, then type "
"some letters of the name you want to phone. You will see all the phone "
"numbers that match your request and their type. When the resulting list's "
"size is greater than the maximum chosen in configuration, it will only "
"display the beginning of the list with the maximum size, and will display a "
"warning message to let you know that your wanted number may be in the rest "
"of the list and so not displayed. In that case you should type some more "
"letters to improve precision of the search. Once you found the right number, "
"double click on the item to call it."
msgstr ""
"Sada kad je sve podešeno, možete otići na &i18n-address-w;, a zatim ukucati "
"slova imena koje želite pozvati. Biće prikazani svi telefonski brojevi koji "
"odgovaraju zahtjevima pretrage i njihovi tipovi. Kada veličina liste prelazi "
"veličinu odabranu u konfiguraciji, onda će biti prikazan početak liste sa "
"maksimalnom veličinom, i biće ispisana poruka upozorenja da vam da do znanja "
"da vaš traženi broj može biti u ostatku liste ali nije prikazan. U tom "
"slučaju trebate ukucati dodatna slova da biste precizirali pretragu. Jednom "
"kada nađete željeni broj, duplim klikom na ikonu pozvaćete traženi broj."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration Dialog"
msgstr "Konfiguracijski dijalog"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:118
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "There are a lot of options in &sflphone;. All of them are gathered and "
#| "sorted in the Configuration Dialog. You can reach it choosing "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure "
#| "&sflphone;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Here are presented some "
#| "commonly useful options."
msgid ""
"There are a lot of options in &Ring;. All of them are gathered and sorted in "
"the Configuration Dialog. You can reach it choosing "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &Ring;...</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>. Here are presented some commonly useful options."
msgstr ""
"Postoji veliki broj opcija u &sflphone;.  Sve su grupisane i sortirane u "
"Konfiguracijskom okviru. Možete ih izabrati u <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Podesi &sflphone;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice>.Ovdje "
"su predstavljene neke često korištene opcije."

#. Tag: title
#: common-use.docbook:121
#, no-c-format
msgid "General settings"
msgstr "Opšte postavke"

#. Tag: para
#: common-use.docbook:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can choose the capacity of the call history."
msgstr "Ovdje možete izabrati kapacitet historije poziva."
